ass=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_M\">\\(K_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16634b9fc07ef245\" href=\"?note=16634b9fc07ef245\" title=\"43-df-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-computable-prefix-machine</a>，初段见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。复杂度在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\)</span> 中比较，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty+c=+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty+c=+\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\le_{\\mathrm{Sch}}Y\\iff\\forall M\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(N)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,K_N(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K_M(Y\\upharpoonright n)+c]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\le_{\\mathrm{Sch}}Y\\iff\\forall M\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(N)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,K_N(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K_M(Y\\upharpoonright n)+c]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是书中非统一版本：N和c可随M改变。使用加常数的方向避免无穷复杂度的减法歧义，也保留原书比较方向。它不是普通前缀复杂度K归约的改名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertio